{"id":"447129","name":"番茄西兰花浓汤","author":"美食妃英理","authorId":"11321699","desc":"","cover":"images/447129/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"番茄","amount":"1个"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1个"},{"name":"西兰花","amount":"1朵"}],"sub":[{"name":"油","amount":"少许"},{"name":"淀粉","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"水","amount":"2碗"},{"name":"盐","amount":"1茶匙"},{"name":"香油","amount":"10滴"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸡蛋黄白分离，西兰花将顶部绿叶部分切碎备用，淀粉加少量水调成水淀粉备用。","img":"images/447129/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"锅内少油，倒入鸡蛋黄液，摊成小饼。","img":"images/447129/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"取出小饼，切碎备用。","img":"images/447129/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅内不加油，倒入番茄丁不停翻炒。","img":"images/447129/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"炒至稍稍融化。","img":"images/447129/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入清水，大火烧开。","img":"images/447129/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"倒入蛋黄丁拌匀。","img":"images/447129/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"调入适量水淀粉至汤浓稠。","img":"images/447129/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"将蛋清液打散淋入锅内。","img":"images/447129/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"西兰花碎倒入锅内。","img":"images/447129/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"调入适量食盐，烧开即可。","img":"images/447129/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}